{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね、学生生活最後の\n体育祭があったんだけど\nみんなで応援するのも競技を\nするのも楽しすぎて....！\n純奈的にリレーの応援がやっぱ\n1番たのしい！もちろん足が遅いので\n応援専門なんだけどね(｡-_-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！\nこんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニー行った時の写真！\nスプラッシュマウンテン行った後\nだったから髪の毛が濡れてしまった。\nゆえにみつあみをしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あと髪の毛切った！\n結構切った！わかるっ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、\n京都握手会2days！\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日目はぜんあく\nゆっちゃんペア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うさぎたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう本当に楽しすぎてやばかったし\nぜったいぜったいまたやりたいです！！\nだいすきゆっちゃん(・ω・)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目はこあく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とおそろい着たよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部はストレートで\n5部は伊織とおそろいにしよーって\n思ってツインテールした！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしかったけどみんなが\n喜んでくれたからよかった(T_T)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間楽しかったです！\nありがとうございました♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/12/4816031/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月11日でお披露目から3年でした！\n長いようで短かったなあと\n思います...。4年目も今まで以上に\n頑張っていきたいと思いますので\n応援よろしくお願いします！！\nみんなだいすきですいつもありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月15日 乃木坂のの\nみおな、まあやさんと出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月19日 ラーメンWalkerTV2\n午前11時から放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、\n15日東京ビックサイトで\nお会いしましょう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい！"}],"source":"archive"}